"``get_percentile()`` mengembalikan objek histogram/statistik; "
"``find_blobs()`` mengembalikan objek blob (\\ ``rect()`` / ``cx()`` / "
"``cy()`` / ``code()`` / ``area()`` / ``pixels()``\\ ) dengan "
"``area_threshold`` / ``pixels_threshold`` / ``merge`` / ``margin`` / "
"``invert`` dan ``x_stride`` / ``y_stride``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added ``sensor.set_lens_correction(enable, radi, coef)`` for "
"OV7725 lens shading, :func:`sensor.set_windowing` now also accepts a ``(w, "
"h)`` tuple (auto-centered), and ``image.Image(..., copy_to_fb=True)`` / "
"``load_image(copy_to_fb=True)``."
msgstr ""
"**Sensor** — ditambahkan ``sensor.set_lens_correction(enable, radi, coef)`` "
"untuk shading lensa OV7725, :func:`sensor.set_windowing` kini juga menerima "
"tuple ``(w, h)`` (dipusatkan otomatis), dan ``image.Image(..., "
"copy_to_fb=True)`` / ``load_image(copy_to_fb=True)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"Added color-tracking, Arduino SPI/I2C-slave, keypoints, and "
"histogram/statistics example scripts."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan skrip contoh untuk pelacakan warna, SPI/I2C-slave Arduino, titik"
" kunci, dan histogram/statistik."

