#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"The IDE can now interrupt a running ``main.py``; faster ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_qrcodes()`` / ``get_statistics()``; ORB uses a popcount Hamming "
"distance; lens correction uses less RAM; a Linux ``udev`` rule stops "
"ModemManager from grabbing the serial port."
msgstr ""
"IDE kini dapat menginterupsi ``main.py`` yang sedang berjalan; "
"``find_blobs()`` / ``find_qrcodes()`` / ``get_statistics()`` lebih cepat; "
"ORB menggunakan jarak Hamming popcount; koreksi lensa menggunakan lebih "
"sedikit RAM; aturan ``udev`` Linux mencegah ModemManager mengambil alih port"
" serial."

